# Everything a generator writes is marked linguist-generated, which collapses it in a GitHub
# diff and keeps it out of the repository's language statistics. Patterns are grouped by the
# thing that writes them, with that thing named in a comment, so this file reads as a list of
# what each generator owns. See the "Keeping `.gitattributes` in sync with the generators"
# section of AGENTS.md before adding or removing one.

# mage dev:vendor
# The whole tree: `go mod vendor` writes all of it, and none of it is this repository's work.
vendor/** linguist-generated

# mage generate:document
# docs/index.md and docs/security.md are copies of README.md and .github/SECURITY.md with their
# links rebased; docs/SUMMARY.md is compiled from the docs/ tree. The sources are hand-written
# and stay unmarked - mark what the generator writes, not what it reads.
docs/index.md linguist-generated
docs/security.md linguist-generated
docs/SUMMARY.md linguist-generated

